      "side": 1,
      "message": "I prefer table-structured tests to be implemented with a function and a closure: https://github.com/google/skia/blob/c432cb7480b5c562b024a67ed2117f9cf58f079d/bazel/exporter/gni_exporter_test.go#L109-L119\n\nWhen a testcase fails, the stacktrace also tells you which case failed, where here one has to add the test.desc to all asserts or that information is lacking.\n\n(Also no anonymous structs, which I find to be a mild readability annoyance).",
